[en.FOCUS_C01_OUTSOURCING_SIRESHOLLOW]
Order at Sire’s Hollow

[en.FOCUS_C01_OUTSOURCING_SIRESHOLLOW_desc]
As the emerging economic center of Equestria, outsourcing to Sire’s Hollow seems like an economical choice. However, this has clearly drawn the ire of competitors Las Pegasus, as well as the Changeling Empire who urges the neutrality of Sire’s Hollow.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_OUTSOURCING_SIRESHOLLOW]
名流谷的大订单

[zh.FOCUS_C01_OUTSOURCING_SIRESHOLLOW_desc]
作为小马利亚新兴的经济中心，外包名流谷似乎是一个经济实惠的选择。但这显然会招致竞争对手洛马基和要求名流谷中立的幻形灵帝国的不满。

